            "1 Lauthwanzingh zikdui phui mak khou",
            "Pikwan khou araana guang thuan ’ki,",
            "Anu khou ramh khwan akhat chuguang e;",
            "Ravguangc Nac Jisu khwan e.",
            "",
            "Kamei ai lev tat ’chamcna kachucna",
            "Saalou e, Ai Kamei di the;",
            "Khou0({ aney bam ’chamcmei ramneilaa",
            "Meic baihmei thay tangh mak ge.",
            "",
            "2 Kakhwan ramgai 0({ chu pwkhou,",
            "’Ruayna guay lu suanmei nthaekc ge;",
            "Kamei ({0 tiimei lu khwan gaymei 0({",
            "Alung khou suanna bam e.",
            "",
            "3 Pikwan khou ai bam saengc nii e,",
            "Adaeng guay hei zingc ngam kan sihni,",
            "’Ki ryanra khwan ({0 tat khang thouclou e,",
            "Ata Kamei kaw bam e."
